cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this build, cite Lean 4 and libriscv.
title: interactor-lean-guest
abstract: >-
  Builds Lean 4 programs as static riscv64 Linux ELF files for
  godot-sandbox (libriscv) guests, with a Lean runtime patched to run
  without the libuv event loop.
type: software
authors:
  - name: V-Sekai-fire
license: Apache-2.0
references:
  - type: software
    title: Lean 4
    url: https://github.com/leanprover/lean4
    license: Apache-2.0
  - type: software
    title: libriscv
    url: https://github.com/libriscv/libriscv
    license: BSD-3-Clause
